  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'CONTAINER CATASTROPHE

    Select any container below the highest completed
    layer. LEFT/RIGHT cycles legal pieces; UP/DOWN chooses the pulling end. ACTION
    stages your full tractor in the marked winch bay and attaches the real cable.
    Then your assigned driving controls operate NWH normally. Hold ACTION to reel;
    watch actual rope tension and ease off before the cable breaks. Press ACTION
    while braking, or RELEASE CABLE in the HUD, to disconnect and reposition; then
    ACTION reconnects within range. Pull the entire physical container clear without
    dropping or tipping another tower piece. The overhead crane physically picks
    up, lifts, rotates and lowers it onto the next top slot. Only a released, actually
    resting container counts as a completed stack. Turns rotate after the tower settles.
    Whoever causes a real tower collapse loses; other players survive. Delayed collapse
    during crane/settling belongs to the last puller. No forced collapse, timer winner
    or simulated AI extraction. One human may play against AI; up to four assigned
    humans. Pause/reconnect/rematch retain the standard Sports lifecycle.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
